Hey striders,

The recent major Multiplayer update has brought not only a lot of new content, but also some bugs. This patch should fix the most common problems.

[h3]We fixed[/h3]
• Occasional game crashes and freezes (the memory leak issue);
• The sound of a shotgun shot being played across the entire map;
• A bug of the progression system. Previously, the UI did not display the correct amount of experience when reaching a new level;
• The possibility of spamming voiceover lines when taking and dropping the flag in Capture The Flag;
• A bug with infinite wall-runs.

[h3]We changed[/h3]
• Hit registration (bullets, knife, etc.) is now client-side, so that it works accurate when the player's ping and the server response time are high;
• The weapon selection wheel is now more intuitive, an icon with the selected weapon appears in front of the player's face when they change weapons;
• The location of sights on different types of weapons is now unified and displayed in the same place on all guns;
• The slide mechanic now works as in the single-player modes;
• The fade-in and fade-out visuals when finding a match have been changed;
• Increased the flag collision for the ease of grabbing it mid-air and on the move.

[h3]We added[/h3]
• A 5-second invulnerability when the player respawns in team modes to prevent spawn kills;
• The ability to collect pickups by hand;
• The ability to remove the sights from the weapon via a new option in the settings.

Please let us know about your experience after the update in our [url=https://discord.gg/QBr4WDkqWQ]Discord server[/url].

Have a nice weekend✌️
Joy Way

Hey!

We just released a hotfix for yesterday's update. It should fix some of the known issues and bring a few gameplay changes.

[b]We added:[/b]
• System that slows down the wall of death at sharp turns in the Endless mode;
• New sections for the generation pool that were impassable before.

[b]We fixed:[/b]
• Drone teleportation;
• Drones no longer spawn a second time if a quest is restarted;
• The shotgun damage against snipers is increased, also their bodies now are discarding from shot's impact;
• New sounds and effects.

[b]We changed:[/b]
• The "chain" quest was removed because of its unpopularity among players;
• The healthpacks no longer spawn if your HP is full;
• Optimized some of the new sections from the generation pool.

Let us know what you think about these changes! Feel free to share your feedback and noted bugs in our [url=https://discord.gg/QBr4WDkqWQ]Discord community[/url].

Cheers,
Joy Way

Hey striders!

Although most players experience multiplayer without any problems, some bugs still remain. This update should fix the most common problems.

[b]We fixed:[/b]
• Server problems when joining multiplayer, searching and leaving a match;
• Occasional game crashes;
• Issues with adding friends in lobby using the social UI;
• Incorrect display of interface elements in the pause menu;
• Infinite “Entering game” screen issue when loading into a match (we need your feedback on this one).

[b]We changed:[/b]
• In King of the Hill, the maximum speed of the player who carries the crown will decrease over time;
• In Horde, if all zombie players leave the match, some of the remaining survivors will become zombies. 

[b]We added:[/b]
• Mute function. Now you can mute a specific person, keeping the voice chat on;
• New skin for the player's avatar.

Please let us know about your experience after the update here or in our [url=https://discord.gg/QBr4WDkqWQ]Discord server[/url].
